      "start_seconds": 0.8,
      "end_seconds": 4.85,
      "duration_seconds": 4.05,
      "text": "Well, morning, doctor. Lovely to meet you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 6.48,
      "end_seconds": 10.46,
      "duration_seconds": 3.98,
      "text": "No problem at all, come in. What's troubling you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 11.03,
      "end_seconds": 24.73,
      "duration_seconds": 13.7,
      "text": "So, morning, doctor. I'll stay and fill in anything that's missed. Right, doctor, it's a mole that has changed. That's what we're worried about."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 25.75,
      "end_seconds": 26.92,
      "duration_seconds": 1.17,
      "text": "Since when exactly?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 29.35,
      "end_seconds": 33.03,
      "duration_seconds": 3.68,
      "text": "Around two weeks, um, I think."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 34.32,
      "end_seconds": 40.74,
      "duration_seconds": 6.42,
      "text": "Sorry, what was I saying, I think it's been nearer three weeks, actually."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 41.79,
      "end_seconds": 46.26,
      "duration_seconds": 4.47,
      "text": "Okay, so roughly two to three weeks. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 47.73,
      "end_seconds": 50.87,
      "duration_seconds": 3.14,
      "text": "Well, I suppose so, yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 52.76,
      "end_seconds": 54.9,
      "duration_seconds": 2.14,
      "text": "Is it accompanied by anything?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 55.79,
      "end_seconds": 70.22,
      "duration_seconds": 14.43,
      "text": "Another new spot on my arm goes along with it, most of the time. The another new spot on my arm? That's been for about three months."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 70.97,
      "end_seconds": 75.25,
      "duration_seconds": 4.28,
      "text": "Anything in your past medical history I should know?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 76.01,
      "end_seconds": 86.21,
      "duration_seconds": 10.2,
      "text": "Hmm, um, I have COPD. It's a relief to finally sit down and talk about it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 91.13,
      "end_seconds": 94.58,
      "duration_seconds": 3.45,
      "text": "Alright, COPD, that matches what I have here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 112.49,
      "end_seconds": 116.33,
      "duration_seconds": 3.84,
      "text": "Okay, are there any illnesses in your family?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 117.46,
      "end_seconds": 120.54,
      "duration_seconds": 3.08,
      "text": "Hmm, my son has asthma."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 121.18,
      "end_seconds": 124.02,
      "duration_seconds": 2.84,
      "text": "A few questions about your lifestyle now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 124.54,
      "end_seconds": 137.66,
      "duration_seconds": 13.12,
      "text": "I'm a plumber, lots of bending and kneeling. I drink a lot of tea and snack through the day. I hardly move around during the day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 139.45,
      "end_seconds": 142.59,
      "duration_seconds": 3.14,
      "text": "Is there any regular medication you use?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 143.1,
      "end_seconds": 148.16,
      "duration_seconds": 5.06,
      "text": "Right, you know, no, nothing at the moment."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 163.28,
      "end_seconds": 168.37,
      "duration_seconds": 5.09,
      "text": "Are you allergic to anything? Any allergies to medicines or foods?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 169.09,
      "end_seconds": 173.74,
      "duration_seconds": 4.65,
      "text": "No, uh, not that I know of."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 175.81,
      "end_seconds": 181.91,
      "duration_seconds": 6.1,
      "text": "Alright, did you get history of skin cancer, weight loss or pain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 182.49,
      "end_seconds": 189.7,
      "duration_seconds": 7.21,
      "text": "Um, I haven't had history of skin cancer, weight loss or pain, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 190.28,
      "end_seconds": 195.35,
      "duration_seconds": 5.07,
      "text": "Any lumps in the armpit or history of sunburn at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 196.39,
      "end_seconds": 207.24,
      "duration_seconds": 10.85,
      "text": "Sorry, what was I saying, I haven't had lumps in the armpit or history of sunburn, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 208.49,
      "end_seconds": 212.25,
      "duration_seconds": 3.76,
      "text": "So, on the cardiac side, anything I should know?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 213.27,
      "end_seconds": 215.06,
      "duration_seconds": 1.79,
      "text": "Nothing like that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 216.37,
      "end_seconds": 218.71,
      "duration_seconds": 2.34,
      "text": "Let's start with the basic checks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 228.22,
      "end_seconds": 230.9,
      "duration_seconds": 2.68,
      "text": "Bear with me while this finishes..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 251.23,
      "end_seconds": 275.37,
      "duration_seconds": 24.14,
      "text": "Okay: heart rate 68, saturation 98 percent. And blood pressure 125 over 72, temperature is 36.7 degrees. Listening to the whole story, it points towards a pigmented lesion that needs to be looked at more closely. It could also be a seborrhoeic keratosis, so we'll keep that open."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 293.14,
      "end_seconds": 297.24,
      "duration_seconds": 4.1,
      "text": "Let's book a skin biopsy to look into changing mole."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 299.12,
      "end_seconds": 301.33,
      "duration_seconds": 2.21,
      "text": "Mm, um, alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 302.13,
      "end_seconds": 305.62,
      "duration_seconds": 3.49,
      "text": "Right, does all of that make sense?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 307.3,
      "end_seconds": 311.52,
      "duration_seconds": 4.22,
      "text": "Right, I'll do that. Thank you, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
